# Normalize all text files to LF everywhere (working tree included).
#
# Why: the Windows CI runner checks out with CRLF by default, and a CRLF
# scripts/ensure-crypto-native.mjs makes vitest's module loader die with
# "SyntaxError: Invalid or unexpected token" (reproduced locally 2026-10-13;
# node --check passes, the .ts files are unaffected — only the CRLF .mjs
# through vitest's loader fails). text=auto leaves real binaries untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
